   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Close-up detail: bright median (~121) with deep blacks (p1 ~3), red-brown shadows (41,23,19), clean warm highlights (222,212,198), reds 58% of colour mass, vivid skin (hue 23 / sat 0.44), saturation 0.37. Best for: Tight head-and-shoulders portraits, groom and bride close-ups, character faces (elders, priests, artisans), hyper-detailed skin. Texture and clarity are high - not for soft beauty.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
